"""TraceMap research: evidence-tiered reverse impact with cycle guard.

Models static code-graph affected analysis: backward traversal over
EXTRACTED and INFERRED references, explicit cycle guarding, relationship-site
evidence, and fail-closed blocking of AMBIGUOUS edges (loud incomplete graph).
