"""Selected call-target traversal for assembly call-graph projection.

Resolve external MemberRef operands through owner-retained, active assembly
participants against a frozen correspondence manifest. Physical call-site
identity stays separate from logical member correspondence; inactive shadows
and ambiguous candidates are never indexed or traversed.
"""

edge ExternalOperand { }
edge SelectedParticipant { }
edge SuppliesDefinition { }
edge PlanDeclares { }
edge TypeForwards { }

node BodyArtifact {
    has assembly_name: str = "";
    has manifest_frozen: bool = False;
}

node RetainedParticipant {
